  "content": "<h1>水下視野</h1>\n<p>在水下看得更清楚！</p>\n<p>這是一個非常簡單的模組，透過將霧效推遠並提升水下的光線等級，大幅改善水下視野。</p>\n<h3>依賴項</h3>\n<p>此模組需要：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fzzy-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fzzy Config</a></p>\n<h3>設定</h3>\n<p>您只能透過 Mod Menu 或設定檔來調整此模組。<br>您可以在其中關閉模組，或僅調整霧效距離。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d853\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1a434cb888cd675034184ac4173bb6e379e5f3a.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Partner Banner\">點擊橫幅或此處以支持我及我的專案！ :)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M7DWJCH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\"></a></p>",
